    "title": "Guardians News: It's Now or Never - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Quincy Wheeler ,\n1 days ago The opportunity for the Guardians to save their season starts tonight. After these three games against the Tigers, the Guardians’ schedule gets pretty easy for a while. Managing to win this series would be potentially a huge kickstart to a chance for a run. Cleveland is 6-0 against Detroit this season so one more win clinched the season series. Read full article",
